//! Work orders (L2-G01; L3-G-020, 021, 022, 026): corrective work orders raised from a ticket,
//! technician assignment / reassignment (append-only `work_order_assignment` history), start →
//! complete → verify (verification resolves the ticket and completes a preventive cycle) or
//! reopen, cancellation. Preventive work orders are generated by `plans`.

